{"code":20000,"message":"OK","data":{"items":[{"id":15067,"public_date":1789401600,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"《国务院关于出境入境管理的规定》9月15日起施行","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":2,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 《国务院关于出境入境管理的规定》7月31日公布，自2026年9月15日起施行。规定共19条，旨在规范出境入境管理，保障出境入境人员合法权益，维护国家主权、安全、发展利益。（新华社）"},{"id":15133,"public_date":1789434000,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"中金公司：吸收合并获批，A股股票将自9月15日开市起连续停牌","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":3,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 中金公司公告称，公司拟开展换股吸收合并重大资产重组项目的A股异议股东收购请求权有关事宜，已获证监会批复同意吸收合并东兴证券和信达证券。为确保A股异议股东收购请求权实施顺利进行，公司A股股票将自2026年9月15日开市起连续停牌。"},{"id":15065,"public_date":1789435200,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"恒生指数公司：希音将快速纳入恒生综合指数","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":3,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 恒生指数公司公告，希音符合快速纳入规则要求，将于9月14日收市后被纳入恒生综合指数及其分类指数。9月15日开盘生效。"},{"id":15148,"public_date":1789435800,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"中国70城房价","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":4,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9