70,"public_date":1789531320,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"钢谷网公布中西部建材产量和库存","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":1,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":""},{"id":15142,"public_date":1789531320,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"欧元区","title":"欧盟与加拿大拟宣布全新全方位伙伴关系","event":"","country_id":"EA","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":2,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/36e5a3fc-e45d-4a66-ae52-240d231779d9.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 欧盟委员会拟于9月16日冯德莱恩盟情咨文演讲中宣布与加拿大的全新全方位伙伴关系，据彭博报道涵盖贸易与安全、加拿大总理卡尼出席。该框架被视为欧美在供应链与防务上进一步绑定，市场关注其对跨大西洋贸易格局及地缘避险情绪的影响。"},{"id":15069,"public_date":1789531320,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"恒大汽车：将举行董事会会议审议及批准集团财务业绩","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":2,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 恒大汽车在港交所公告，公司将于2026年9月16日（星期三）举行董事会会议，藉以（其中包括）审议及批准集团的财务业绩。\n 于2026年9月16日举行的会议上，董事会将审议及批准截至2026年6月30日止六个月的中期业绩。应公司要求，股份已自2025年4月1日上午九时正起暂停于联交所主板买卖，以待刊发其尚未刊发的财务业绩及达成公司日期为2025年4月17日、2025年8月7日及2026年6月16日的公告所载的复牌指引，并将继续暂停买卖，直至进一步通知。"},{"id":15068,"public_date":1789531320,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"香港首个五年规划9月16日公布","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":3,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 香港特区行政长官李家超今日宣布，香港首个五年规划将和新一份施政报告于9月16日一同公布。（大湾区之声）"},{"id":15130,"public_date":1789538400,"observation_date":"","wscn_ticker":"","country":"中国","title":"“豆包手机”发布并上市","event":"","country_id":"CN","quantity":"","unit":"","importance":4,"mark":"","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg","calendar_key":"","actual":"","forecast":"","previous":"","revised":"","period":"","calendar_type":"FE","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"","assets":"","foresight":"前瞻 | 中兴通讯与字节跳动联合研发的全球首款AI智能体手机——努比亚 NaviX Ultra（被称为“豆包手机”或“豆包手机二代”）已正式官宣定档 9月16日 14:00 发布并上市。"},{"id":1591915,"public_date":1789538400,"observation_date":"2026-08-01","wscn_ticker":"UK111562","country":"英国","title":"8月核心零售物价指数同比","event":"核心零售物价指数同比","country_id":"UK","quantity":"","unit":"%","importance":2,"mark":"BB","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3969b3d1-8eea-492e-8190-c4a9a710878d.jpg","calendar_key":"bca885d8f7992127b8aaf5e01094982b","actual":"3.3","forecast":"","previous":"3.1","revised":"","period":"月","calendar_type":"FD","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/UK111562/overview","assets":"fx","foresight":""},{"id":1591914,"public_date":1789538400,"observation_date":"2026-08-01","wscn_ticker":"UK111560","country":"英国","title":"8月零售物价指数同比","event":"零售物价指数同比","country_id":"UK","quantity":"","unit":"%","importance":2,"mark":"BB","push_status":false,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3969b3d1-8eea-492e-8190-c4a9a710878d.jpg","calendar_key":"53751f09886204282b97a64f19ef0a1a","actual":"3.4","forecast":"3.5","previous":"3.2","revised":"","period":"月","calendar_type":"FD","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/UK111560/overview","assets":"fx","foresight":""},{"id":159191